{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUS! - Spies vs Thieves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust No One. Blend In. Take the Shot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/74776b9fb37d31513807623ad7bf21b7.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/74776b9fb37d31513807623ad7bf21b7.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/74776b9fb37d31513807623ad7bf21b7.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>SUS!</i> two teams battle it out in chaotic rounds of deception, stealth, and pure confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Thieves</strong> sneak through the city to eliminate their targets and steal briefcases of cash,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while the <strong>Spies</strong> try to uncover and eliminate them - without hitting innocent bystanders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the wrong person, and it\u2019s <i>game over for your reputation!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cc5df7a847734de5aa7e392aac4e561d.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cc5df7a847734de5aa7e392aac4e561d.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cc5df7a847734de5aa7e392aac4e561d.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your perfect match with full control over the rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>match duration</strong>, number of <strong>targets</strong>, and <strong>briefcases</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust how many <strong>innocents you can hit</strong> before losing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable or disable <strong>eliminating Spies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whether Thieves must <strong>steal and assassinate</strong> or complete just one task<br>Every round can play out <i>completely differently!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 Unique Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, <i>SUS!</i> features <strong>five maps</strong>, each with its own layout, hiding spots, and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map challenges players to adapt their disguises, timing, and tactics to stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disguise Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cd6122ceb9cc853d38587ea8d285b835.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cd6122ceb9cc853d38587ea8d285b835.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cd6122ceb9cc853d38587ea8d285b835.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Spies and Thieves can <strong>disguise themselves</strong> among innocent NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows who\u2019s who - until it\u2019s too late. Watch your back\u2026 and your teammates\u2019 too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smoke, Vanish, Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/260f20de055f71b0f98cc1f6bfa4ba23.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/260f20de055f71b0f98cc1f6bfa4ba23.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/260f20de055f71b0f98cc1f6bfa4ba23.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw a <strong>smoke bomb</strong> to make a quick getaway or confuse the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the smoke clears, only the smart ones remain standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t Cough Too Loud\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 20\u201340 seconds, Thieves <strong>can\u2019t help but cough</strong>, giving away a <strong>rough clue</strong> to their location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your nerves steady - one cough could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cartoon Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget realistic blood and grit -\u00a0<i>SUS!</i> keeps it fun and stylish with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>cartoony speech bubbles</strong> and exaggerated reactions for every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s chaotic, colorful, and full of personality</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138400?t=1771262115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138400?t=1771262115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/11b987383bbc9bba2af9cc1ec8e5d8939d1e2451/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771262115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/11b987383bbc9bba2af9cc1ec8e5d8939d1e2451/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771262115","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUS! - Spies vs Thieves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust No One. Blend In. Take the Shot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/74776b9fb37d31513807623ad7bf21b7.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/74776b9fb37d31513807623ad7bf21b7.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/74776b9fb37d31513807623ad7bf21b7.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>SUS!</i> two teams battle it out in chaotic rounds of deception, stealth, and pure confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Thieves</strong> sneak through the city to eliminate their targets and steal briefcases of cash,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while the <strong>Spies</strong> try to uncover and eliminate them - without hitting innocent bystanders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the wrong person, and it\u2019s <i>game over for your reputation!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cc5df7a847734de5aa7e392aac4e561d.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cc5df7a847734de5aa7e392aac4e561d.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cc5df7a847734de5aa7e392aac4e561d.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your perfect match with full control over the rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>match duration</strong>, number of <strong>targets</strong>, and <strong>briefcases</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust how many <strong>innocents you can hit</strong> before losing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable or disable <strong>eliminating Spies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whether Thieves must <strong>steal and assassinate</strong> or complete just one task<br>Every round can play out <i>completely differently!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 Unique Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, <i>SUS!</i> features <strong>five maps</strong>, each with its own layout, hiding spots, and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map challenges players to adapt their disguises, timing, and tactics to stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disguise Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cd6122ceb9cc853d38587ea8d285b835.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cd6122ceb9cc853d38587ea8d285b835.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/cd6122ceb9cc853d38587ea8d285b835.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Spies and Thieves can <strong>disguise themselves</strong> among innocent NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows who\u2019s who - until it\u2019s too late. Watch your back\u2026 and your teammates\u2019 too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smoke, Vanish, Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/260f20de055f71b0f98cc1f6bfa4ba23.poster.avif?t=1771262115\" width=584 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/260f20de055f71b0f98cc1f6bfa4ba23.webm?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/extras/260f20de055f71b0f98cc1f6bfa4ba23.mp4?t=1771262115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw a <strong>smoke bomb</strong> to make a quick getaway or confuse the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the smoke clears, only the smart ones remain standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t Cough Too Loud\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 20\u201340 seconds, Thieves <strong>can\u2019t help but cough</strong>, giving away a <strong>rough clue</strong> to their location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your nerves steady - one cough could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cartoon Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget realistic blood and grit -\u00a0<i>SUS!</i> keeps it fun and stylish with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>cartoony speech bubbles</strong> and exaggerated reactions for every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s chaotic, colorful, and full of personality</p>","developers":["SUSDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138400/5f8ca4a4c0aeae7033cc8979dce1e3d68f3a8389/header.jpg?t=1771262115","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138400/607832147/d6ab616de20495ccf7df6106a08f5ffa89a8c1fc/1762999323/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763001429","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138400/607832147/d6ab616de20495ccf7df6106a08f5ffa89a8c1fc/1762999323/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763001429","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138400/607832147/d6ab616de20495ccf7df6106a08f5ffa89a8c1fc/1762999323/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763001429","id":257230290,"name":"SUS! Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257230290/3959f882a4674db6f9cfd90cbbc5350ec1b75d7f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763001429"}],"name":"SUS!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 \uff0f Intel Core i5-7500